      <guid>https://miroadamy.com/posts/2019-11-20-from-jekyll-to-hugo/</guid>
      <description>&lt;p&gt;I have decided to consolidate all piecemeal versions of my blogpost uder one roof and at the same to do these four things&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;ol&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;technology upgrade - from Jekyll to Hugo&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;visual refresh of the page&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;review tagging and categorization&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;merge hidden posts from Wikis to one place&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;/ol&gt;&#xA;&#xA;&lt;h2 class=&#34;relative group&#34;&gt;Why Hugo replaced Jekyll&#xA;    &lt;div id=&#34;why-hugo-replaced-jekyll&#34; class=&#34;anchor&#34;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;    &#xA;    &lt;span&#xA;        class=&#34;absolute top-0 w-6 transition-opacity opacity-0 -start-6 not-prose group-hover:opacity-100 select-none&#34;&gt;&#xA;        &lt;a class=&#34;text-primary-300 dark:text-neutral-700 !no-underline&#34; href=&#34;#why-hugo-replaced-jekyll&#34; aria-label=&#34;Anchor&#34;&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&#xA;    &lt;/span&gt;&#xA;    &#xA;&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;The version 3 of my blog (see below for a bit of history) has been hosted on &lt;a href=&#34;https://pages.github.com/&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noreferrer&#34;&gt;Github pages&lt;/a&gt; and using the default static site generators - &lt;a href=&#34;https://jekyllrb.com/&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noreferrer&#34;&gt;Jekyll&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
      
